        {
          "id": "EH-C1",
          "title": "State Relationship",
          "status": "FROZEN",
          "summary": "Empty Home 与 Normal Home 是同一个 HomeScreen 的两个内容状态，不是两套首页。",
          "points": [
            "EMPTY：有效 FishRecord 数量 = 0。",
            "NORMAL：有效 FishRecord 数量 ≥ 1。",
            "登录/游客状态与 Empty/Normal 状态正交，不能用于选择首页形态。",
            "拍摄、相册、账号入口继续复用生产回调；禁止复制第二套 Home / Camera / Picker 流程。"
          ],
          "authority": "design/pages/home/empty_home/spec/Empty_Home_Spec_Closure_V1.md"
        },
        {
          "id": "EH-C2",
          "title": "Component Ownership",
          "status": "FROZEN",
          "summary": "公共系统与 Empty Home 私有构图边界已冻结，公共组件升级不得反向破坏页面私有视觉。",
          "points": [
            "Shared：BG_ENV_HERO / Morning_Lake_Sunrise_Hero_V1。",
            "Shared：Primary Capture Button / home_primary_capture。",
            "Shared：Color & Typography、Spacing & Radius。",
            "Page-owned：品牌头部构图、Hero Copy 与金色收笔、鱼竿/鱼线/鱼漂/水面接触/波纹。",
            "品牌头部不是通用 TopNavigation；登录/相册复用既有行为回调，但页面落位属于 Empty Home 合同。"
          ],
          "authority": "design/pages/home/empty_home/spec/Empty_Home_Spec_Closure_V1.md"
        },
        {
          "id": "EH-C3",
          "title": "Layer / Z-order",
          "status": "FROZEN",
          "summary": "视觉遮挡顺序与水面接触关系已明确，逻辑层不要求全部拆成独立位图资产。",
          "points": [
            "鱼线从 rod tip (335,1180) 起，终点 (560,1328) 必须落在 water contact (560,1320) 之后/之下。",
            "水面接触层遮挡鱼漂水下部分；禁止完整鱼漂贴在水面。",
            "Ripple 位于水面效果层、露出鱼漂下方；只允许 1 组。",
            "Native UI 与 Camera CTA 位于环境/钓鱼层之上；Camera CTA 为最高可操作焦点。"
          ],
          "authority": "design/pages/home/empty_home/shared/contracts/layer_contract.json"
